        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": false,
        "si_used": true,
        "procedure": "General REE-complex synthesis (SI): 5-chloro-8-hydroxyquinoline (HQCl, 1 mmol) and base (Et3N or BnMe3NOH, 1 mmol) were dissolved in 10 mL absolute EtOH, heated at 60–65 °C until dissolved, then Dy(NO3)3·6H2O (0.25 mmol) in 3 mL EtOH was added and the mixture was stirred at 60–65 °C for 1 h. For [Dy3(QCl)8(NO3)], using Et3N or BnMe3NOH, the yellow solid was isolated by centrifugation, washed with EtOH, and dried under reduced pressure. Crystals for SCXRD were grown by hexane diffusion into a dichloromethane solution of the compound.",
